{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WUSCQzxgUVEep9w45Xy9LS","type":"tool_result","content":"Next, choose how you want to set up your database:\n\nCONNECT EXISTING DATABASE:\n  1. Configure your DATABASE_URL in prisma7.config.ts\n  2. Run prisma db pull to introspect your database.\n\nCREATE NEW DATABASE:\n  Local: npx prisma dev (runs Postgres locally in your terminal)\n  Cloud: npx create-db (creates a free Prisma Postgres database)\n\nThen, define your models in prisma/schema.prisma and run prisma migrate dev to apply your schema.\n\nLearn more: https://pris.ly/getting-started\n \n---\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 374 Nov  9 22:25 prisma7.config.ts\n\nprisma:\ntotal 4\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 valentinakoniukhova wheel  96 Nov  9 22:25 .\ndrwx------ 17 valentinakoniukhova wheel 544 Nov  9 22:25 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 307 Nov  9 22:25 schema.prisma\n---\n// This is your Prisma schema file,\n// learn more about it in the docs: https://pris.ly/d/prisma-schema\n\n// Get a free hosted Postgres database in seconds: `npx create-db`\n\ngenerator client {\n  provider = \"prisma-client\"\n  output   = \"../src/generated/prisma\"\n}\n\ndatasource db {\n  provider = \"postgresql\"\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c116ca96-b445-48ac-a9c6-bf58821f9654","uuid":"47a9d7f5-81c5-475f-b88e-65eaa042c6d4","timestamp":"2026-11-10T01:25:35.311Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"Next, choose how you want to set up your database:\n\nCONNECT EXISTING DATABASE:\n  1. Configure your DATABASE_URL in prisma7.config.ts\n  2. Run prisma db pull to introspect your database.\n\nCREATE NEW DATABASE:\n  Local: npx prisma dev (runs Postgres locally in your terminal)\n  Cloud: npx create-db (creates a free Prisma Postgres database)\n\nThen, define your models in prisma/schema.prisma and run prisma migrate dev to apply your schema.\n\nLearn more: https://pris.ly/getting-started\n \n---\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 374 Nov  9 22:25 prisma7.config.ts\n\nprisma:\ntotal 4\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 valentinakoniukhova wheel  96 Nov  9 22:25 .\ndrwx------ 17 valentinakoniukhova wheel 544 Nov  9 22:25 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 307 Nov  9 22:25 schema.prisma\n---\n// This is your Prisma schema file,\n// learn more about it in the docs: https://pris.ly/d/prisma-schema\n\n// Get a free hosted Postgres database in seconds: `npx create-db`\n\ngenerator client {\n  provider = \"prisma-client\"\n  output   = \"../src/generated/prisma\"\n}\n\ndatasource db {\n  provider = \"postgresql\"\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WUSCQzxgUVEep9w45Xy9LS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
